  "citation": "Sloan V; Liebig J; Hahn M; Curtis B; Brooks J; Rogers A; Iversen C; Norby R (2014): Soil temperature, soil moisture and thaw depth, Utqiagvik (Barrow), Alaska, Ver. 1. Next-Generation Ecosystem Experiments (NGEE) Arctic. Dataset. doi:10.5440/1121134",
